WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Wait, napansin nyo ba?

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.800
Parang allergic ang IKEA sa exact prices.

3
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.800
Pero bakit nga ba?

4
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.300
Tara, alamin natin.

5
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.800
Kung hindi ka pa familiar sa IKEA,

6
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:17.000
isa itong Swedish Furniture and Home
Furnishing Company.

7
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.600
They are known for their modern and affordable
home products

8
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.400
na pwede niya assemble.

9
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.400
Now, balik tayo sa tanong ko kanina.

10
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.300
Bakit nga ba? walang exact na price.

11
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:33.940
Isa sa pinakakilalang technique ng
psychological pricing ay ang odd pricing.

12
00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:39.640
Kung saan ang 1000 ay ginagawang 999 pesos.

13
00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:43.460
Diba mas mura siyang tingnan kahit 1 peso lang
ang difference?

14
00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:47.040
Hindi lang isa. Hindi lang dalawa.

15
00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:51.940
Pero halos buong catalog ng IKEA ay naka odd
pricing.

16
00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.740
So paano siya ginagamit ng IKEA?

17
00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:56.440
Ganito yan.

18
00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:01.440
Kapag mas murang tingnan ang presyo, mas naa-
attract nila yung mga customers.

19
00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:04.440
Pero effective nga bang ganitong pricing
strategy?

20
00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:07.440
The answer is yes.

21
00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:13.440
Kasi hindi naman nababago yung product, pero
nagbabago yung perception natin sa presyo.

22
00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:17.440
At sa retail business, minsan, presyo ang
nagpapabili.

23
00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:21.440
Personally, I think effective talaga yung
strategy ni IKEA.

24
00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:25.440
Pero, bilang consumers, maging responsible pa
rin tayo.

25
00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:28.200
na hindi porket nakita natin mukhang mura,

26
00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:30.760
e dapat agad-agad natin bibilhin.

27
00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:34.740
So the next time na makakita ka nang ganitong
prices,

28
00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:37.780
hindi lang basta-bastang bawas sa presyo yan.

29
00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:40.280
Pricing strategy yan!
